# The hemp outfit as worn: the beanie's slouchy tam and the flip-flops' soles and straps.
# Colours are the beanie's and the flip-flops' icons' own. Render with mctex.py render into
# src/main/resources/assets/hempdustry/textures.

@palette default
. = none
R = D10609        red stripe
Y = E3BD14        yellow stripe
G = 377C60        green stripe
g = 1F6448        green, dark: the crown's centre
k = 10141D        the inside of the hat
m = 2A1E1B        sole
d = 1F1514        sole, dark: edges and underside
l = 352722        sole, worn patch
S = 3F2D29        strap

# The tam (models/item/hemp_beanie_worn.json): a band round the head and a wide crown tipped back
# 12 degrees, so it sags behind. Crown top 12x12 at 0,0; the hat's inside at 12,0; the crown's
# sides (red, yellow, green, red) at 0,12, its underside the green row; the band's sides (yellow,
# red, green) at 12,12. Each side is plain rows, so any width of it can be used.
@texture item/hemp_beanie_worn 16x16
RRRRRRRRRRRRkk..
RYYYYYYYYYYRkk..
RYGGGGGGGGYR....
RYGRRRRRRGYR....
RYGRYYYYRGYR....
RYGRYggYRGYR....
RYGRYggYRGYR....
RYGRYYYYRGYR....
RYGRRRRRRGYR....
RYGGGGGGGGYR....
RYYYYYYYYYYR....
RRRRRRRRRRRR....
RRRRRRRRRRRRYYYY
YYYYYYYYYYYYRRRR
GGGGGGGGGGGGGGGG
RRRRRRRRRRRR....

# The flip-flops (FlipFlopsRenderer), box UV. Sole 5x1x6 at 0,0: top at 6,0, underside at 11,0,
# edges on row 6. Strap shell 4x2x4 at 0,8: only its sides are drawn, row 12-13: side, front (the
# V and its toe post), side, back.
@texture entity/equipment/flip_flops 32x16
......mmlmmddddd................
......mmmmmddddd................
......mlmmmddddd................
......mmmmmddddd................
......mmmlmddddd................
......lmmmmddddd................
dddddddddddddddddddddd..........
................................
................................
................................
................................
................................
..SSS..SSS......................
.....SS.........................
................................
................................
